    "updated_at": "2026-01-08T01:44:07Z",
    "body": "I was surprised this wasn't already specified! In practice, Blink copies the data as you'd expect.\n\nThere's also a subtle spec error hiding here, in that [the definition of the send() method](https://websockets.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-websocket-send) delegates to the [send a WebSocket Message](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6455#section-6.1) algorithm from RFC6455, but that's actually a blocking algorithm. So the WebSocket spec should say \"In parallel, \" there somewhere.",
